admin_drm_scheduler 1

description
	DRM Scheduler e-mail integration.
	Locates cmail.exe / recipients.txt (bundled as module resources) and
	e-mails the HTML ETL summary report produced by astri_data_migrator -
	used by both the scheduled batch runs (.bat) and the Work Order dialog
	"Migrate All" action.
end

requires
	base
	rwwi_astri_integration
end

language en_gb
